Maintainer: Lenik <audiocfg@bodz.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, pkgconf, check, libbas-c-dev, libpulse-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/lenik/audiocfg
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: audiocfg
Architecture: any
Depends: 
    ${shlibs:Depends}, 
    ${misc:Depends}
Description: PulseAudio device and profile configuration utility
 audiocfg lists PulseAudio playback and capture devices, shows card
 profiles, sets the active profile on a selected card, and can cycle
 through a list of profiles with --toggle.
